{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_04_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e3b6304f56e20142af847b60eb087c50d3a9b8dcc7d4937fc3c49e76b470ed0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ff00985297362559ca57feb0fea016034f3eedd05d140b8717fcdaaff6e1919",
      "text": "话说回来，刚才开始飘过来的这股海潮香气是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96b6ac272dbe807e47ae9f48e3e0a12b1148ac2cedaf838d3d12a153b43f0072",
      "text": "您注意到了吗！\n为了今天，我从昨晚就开始准备的料理。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8749e8c1bd604b82d8629fa981e019b2c31928a5c17a12c5e44172d0364b2f01",
      "text": "地中海风味西班牙海鲜饭、西式炖鲷鱼。\n蒜香油浸峨螺，还有鲣鱼卡尔帕乔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ca29a7c5ebc0e9950a4704725b016af120da6d4e4ce01794288bd5fbcef9361",
      "text": "顺便一提，峨螺的唾液腺中，虽然有时会含有名为四甲铵的\n毒素……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb85bcf3f954d2205f054caf695b0b0d980251de6fa87dfd6eec7ecd9e021e50",
      "text": "但内脏已经全部去除干净了，请放心。\n请尽情享受海鲜的魅力吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09f15af2eaad36b6be4760f567c536e8972c770caf2b4b7254ec67ae11778576",
      "text": "之前我就挺在意的，\n你可真是非同一般地热爱大海啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34a999841f45dcdc020b2182137b72cfa87fe2ab8a1d25b820e4369d9859ee11",
      "text": "是的！我是为了传达大海的魅力，\n才立志走上偶像之路的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb9746e8a99697c633f4389da30909257f7084fbf761c69aa18fefd0cb7df660",
      "text": "顺便说一句，我呢，是为了顺从本心，\n赚取每日的口粮哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b736116406889cab4705871231148810029bcc07b6d7f9c5e3276f9973c13436",
      "text": "而我，则是为了清扫演艺圈的污垢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39aba47f420547d6ee42dafae9a66a647f18b0c432b1224e4110e42ae6ca9aa8",
      "text": "各自的目标全然不同，真是一群有趣的家伙。\n我们三个人的话，今后看起来不会无聊了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f0143873fa3750f4ebef8a4d63fdc93748020e9b6a1095466c69bd478aa2899",
      "text": "乐在其中固然好，可也别忘了这是工作哦～\n在这个圈子里被埋没、进退维谷什么的，我可敬谢不敏～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b5252e34a5e21beaa222a5e3f181aa9b4295c331559af7a487e86ad9df159be",
      "text": "那是自然。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_j:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ea83f329d94bcfa6aaed5f24be820436f760e16b0d0a6856a2950552254e861",
      "text": "异彩各缤纷，共赴同一路。\n某种意义上，感觉会成为一个默契十足的组合呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
